network LineModel ⟦
    dense ⟬1⸴ 1⟭ ·
⟧

process main⦅⦆ → int64 ⟦
    tensor⟨float64⟩⟬4⸴ 1⟭ x ↦ tensor⟬⟬1.0⟭⸴ ⟬2.0⟭⸴ ⟬3.0⟭⸴ ⟬4.0⟭⟭ ·
    tensor⟨float64⟩⟬4⸴ 1⟭ y ↦ tensor⟬⟬2.0⟭⸴ ⟬4.0⟭⸴ ⟬6.0⟭⸴ ⟬8.0⟭⟭ ·
    learn LineModel on x ⸴ y ⟦
        loss mse ·
        optimizer sgd ·
        lr ↦ 0.05 ·
        epochs ↦ 100 ·
    ⟧
    tensor⟨float64⟩⟬1⟭ test_x ↦ tensor⟬3.0⟭ ·
    tensor⟨float64⟩⟬1⟭ pred ↦ LineModel⦅test_x⦆ ·
    emit pred ·
    yield 0 ·
⟧

